## Title: ContainerVisitHide
## Description: Hides HarvestMap pins for containers (chests, heavy sacks, thieves troves, safeboxes, stashes) after you loot them, until a timer expires. Companion for HarvestMap — fixes the missing hide-used filter for non-resource nodes.
